msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:110
#: eaecc4611afb4abaa77ac51322ef3d0e
msgid "To use RTL, GPS lock needs to be achieved (Blue GPS LED and Blue APM LED on solid not blinking) before arming and takeoff to establish the home or launch position."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:113
#: 6e7b77d3a2874f59a15b4e9a6c2faa7f
msgid "Landing and re-arming the copter will reset home, which is a great feature for flying at airfields."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:115
#: 1cbbc5272221404e97ac89f3fcca37b2
msgid "If you get lock for the first time while flying, your home will be set at the location of lock."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:117
#: ec7fba5f17aa47ca9aed90b99c44c073
msgid "If you set the :ref:`RTL_ALT_M<RTL_ALT_M>` to a number at other than 0 it will go to and maintain that altitude while returning."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:119
#: 93ec032f56eb48f8a522c5f589540964
msgid "RTL uses :ref:`WP_SPD<WP_SPD>` to determine how fast it travels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/rtl-mode.rst:120
#: ac1e0e35e3d142488ea204a54a6e1638
msgid "Once the copter arrives at the home location the copter will pause for ``RTL_LOIT_TIME`` milliseconds, timeout (AUTO_LAND), then land."
msgstr ""
